# vactr showcase: a sample-free techno groove with a live visual chain.
# Press Run (Mod-Shift-Enter) to play.
use-bpm 132

s :analog > note [:c1 :c1 :c1 :c1] > wave :sine > decay 0.18 > gain 0.24 > d1
s :fm > note [nil :g4 nil :g4] > ratio 7 > index 3 > decay 0.12 > gain 0.16 > d2
s :analog > note [:c2 :c2 :g1 :bb1] > wave :saw > cutoff {range sine 300 900} > res 0.3 > gain 0.2 > d3
s :pd > chord {alt [:c :m7] [:f :maj7]} > voicing > release 0.4 > gain 0.18 > d4
s :additive > note [:c4] > attack 0.8 > release 1.2 > lpf 1200 > gain 0.1 > d5
s :fm > note [:c6 :eb6 :g6 :bb6] > ratio 11 > index 2 > decay 0.04 > gain 0.08 > d6
osc {* 20 {sin time}} > rotate 0.5 > kaleid 4 > out o0
